00:15:47,040 --> 00:15:48,560
Sunk cost can't be found.

371
00:15:48,560 --> 00:15:51,080
Yes, yes, you could recover your fixed cost.

372
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,640
So you could go and resell the factory and get your A back

